WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.480
Blazing Thunder and Rending Thunder...

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.710
Are you also... a Sword Shaman?

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:11.450
I am the Six-Blade Priestess...

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.780
The Sword Shaman of Shadow.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.410
The Six-Blade Priestess? 
From the Taishi Bureau?

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.340
That explains a lot.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.200
In other words, you're 
in the same line of work as me...

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.700
an attack mage in service to the nation, 
who lives by its orders.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.590
I work for the Lion King Organization 
while you work for the Taishi Bureau.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:33.100
I'm Kisaki Kiriha,

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.800
and I am not your enemy.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.970
You realize that, do you not?

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:42.480
Forgive me if I don't believe that, 
after you left me dressed like this.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.520
What's the idea?

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:55.840
You know the government 
is not a monolith, nor are its views.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.740
When one's position changes, 
so does one's goal.

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.800
But you don't need to worry.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:04.460
Once I complete this job, 
you will be set free.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.350
But first, I need you to become

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:10.320
a vessel for her power, just for a bit.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.190
"Her"?

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:18.430
This power... You don't 
mean the Witch of the Night?!

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:20.310
So Eguchi Yume is...

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:24.010
How... could you...

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:28.730
A foolish question, Kirasaka Sayaka.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.330
The Taishi Bureau only acts for one reason.

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.280
To protect this country... no,

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.360
to protect the world.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:40.600
Even if it has to sink 
Itogami Island to achieve that.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:26.590
Oh...

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:29.260
I guess we fell asleep.

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.920
Guess I'll go back to sleep...

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.620
...ina...san...

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:41.210
Yaze?

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:43.170
Hiina-san!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.480
Hey, you okay, man?

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.630
I mean, that was partly 
your fault, though...

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.910
They got me, damn it...

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.040
Mind... control?

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.290
H-Hey... Yaze!

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.360
No, don't...

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:06.520
Kojou-san, stay away...

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.270
Uh, but I—

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:13.330
Don't look! Please don't look at me!

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:14.720
Huh?!

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:18.690
No!

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.070
Wait!

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:25.060
Senpai...

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:29.090
Himeragi! You're awake?

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:30.320
Perfect timing!

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:34.010
Yume just grew a tail! 
It was right between her thighs!

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:36.550
Um, Senpai...

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.790
She may be in elementary school,

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:43.230
but it's not unusual for girls her age 
to experience changes like that.

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:47.520
I mean... I think so, at least...

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:49.210
What are you talking about?!

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.380
I said it was a tail! A <i>tail</i>!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.420
I don't think it was a typical 
therianthrope transformation.

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:57.370
I'm not sure what, but <i>something</i> 
was different about it!

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:01.360
Yume-chan, Yume-chan...

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.840
You like a little girl like her that much?!

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.830
Huh?! What are you even saying, Himeragi?!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.410
This is no time to kid around!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.920
Don't try to dodge the issue!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:13.120
Remember, <i>I'm</i> your observer!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.600
Yet you spend all your time worrying 
about Sayaka-san and Yume-chan...

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:19.930
And during the day, you're 
always alone with Aiba-senpai,

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.240
flirting and schmoozing the day away!

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:30.010
Am I just... not good enough for you?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:34.320
Can I not... satisfy you?

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:36.080
Uh... No, it's not...

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:41.320
I-It's not about whether 
you can s-satisfy me or not!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.900
You feel unfulfilled?

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.800
I see.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.770
Then as your observer,

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:49.490
my only choice is to kill you, 
and then die myself!

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.170
Schneesturm Wolfin!

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:59.370
A-Are you nuts?! You can't 
just whip that out here!

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:02.890
What are you two doing at this hour, 
and without telling me?

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:04.930
Asagi?!

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:08.240
Uh, we were just... I mean, you know...

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:11.640
Flirting with Himeragi-san 
behind my back again?

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.190
So you really do like her more than me.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.570
Have you gone crazy, too?!

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:24.890
I've been trying my hardest, too...

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.000
I did all those embarrassing things...

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:33.860
That's enough, Aiba-senpai.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.990
H-Himeragi?

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:39.280
I've undone the mind control she was under.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.240
She should return to her right mind now.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:45.730
So someone <i>was</i> making her act like that.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.970
Himeragi, you were...

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:50.590
Yes, I was, so... well...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:55.090
Just know that what I said earlier 
wasn't how I really feel!

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:56.440
It wasn't, okay?!

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.370
O-Okay...

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.400
Kojou-kun...

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:10.870
You know, Kojou-kun, I actually...

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:13.850
Himeragi, would you mind?

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.460
On it.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.370
Seriously, what the hell?

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.830
Why is everyone acting like this?

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.050
Aw, how boring.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:31.930
And after I finally made it so 
you could say how you really feel.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:36.880
But my mind control didn't work on you, 
Onii-san. Just who are you?

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:42.650
Kiriha said I'd be able to 
control anyone, even Leviathan.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:44.490
Leviathan?

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:47.490
You're not Yume, are you?

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.160
Who are you?!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.340
I'm Yume, too!

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:55.200
It seems like Yume calls me "Riru," though.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:55.910
Riru?

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:59.480
Do you mean... dissociative identity disorder?

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.420
Are you talking about 
multiple personalities?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:07.840
Which would make me a separate 
personality Yume came up with

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.740
to protect her after a traumatic experience.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.960
You're not wrong, 
but you're not right, either.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.680
A traumatic experience?

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.400
Well, Yume's been bullied her whole life.

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:22.970
By the other kids at school, 
and by her parents, too.

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:23.850
Why?

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:27.820
I mean, isn't it obvious?

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.620
Yume's a succubus.

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.370
There aren't very many succubi,

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.380
but they're good at controlling people.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:39.980
They can get into their minds 
and inflame their desires.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:43.990
Can you imagine an elementary school 
girl being a pervert like that?

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:48.180
Yume didn't want to acknowledge 
the existence of that side of her,

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:52.830
so she separated her succubus powers and 
desires from herself, and they became me.

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:55.660
So Yume's an unregistered demon, too?

00:08:56.920 --> 00:09:00.210
Do you hate Yume now, too?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.300
Of course not.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:02.930
Oh?

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.420
I'm a vampire, you know.

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:08.700
I've been called indecent 
and obscene more times than I can count

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:11.360
while Himeragi and the other 
girls let me suck their blood.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:14.040
A tail's nothing! Hell, I think it's cute!

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:17.760
Oh? You're quite a nice guy, aren't you?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.160
For some reason, that kind of bugs me.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.920
Wait, are you into little girls?

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.040
Like hell I am!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.320
I'm feeling kind of pissed now,

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:29.630
so I guess I'll do what 
Kiriha asked me to do.

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:38.340
Wait, Yume!

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:47.440
Senpai, get down!

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:52.900
What was that thing?

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:54.360
A shikigami.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.780
But this spell is...

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.400
You came for me, Kiriha!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.550
<i>The lady from the magical beast park!</i>

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:12.560
Kisaki Kiriha.

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:15.220
Pleased to meet you, Fourth Progenitor.

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:17.430
If I say I'm the Six-Blade Priestess 
from the Taishi Bureau,

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:20.310
I'm sure the girl 
behind you will understand.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.050
Taishi Bureau?

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:24.060
Like the Lion King Organization,

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.610
it's a division of the 
National Public Safety Commission

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:28.760
that specializes in magic disasters.

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:30.500
And why would one of them be here?

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.500
I'm working, of course.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:35.700
But I have no intention 
of fighting with you two.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.400
<i>I</i> don't, at least.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:40.300
Senpai!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:45.520
Kirasaka? What are you doing here?!

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.450
Let's go, Riru. 
Chairman Kusuki is waiting for you.

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:50.550
Okay!

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.990
Himeragi, can you take care of Yume for me?

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:56.850
I'll do something about Kirasaka.

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:59.400
But, Senpai, Sayaka-san is currently...

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:01.010
I know.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:02.820
It's the mind control, right?

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:06.140
Looks like she's got it worse 
than the rest of you did earlier.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:11.660
All right.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:14.250
Senpai, please be careful.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.160
When Sayaka-san takes a fight seriously,

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.990
even I'm lucky to beat 
her one out of five times!

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:24.320
Damn it!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.480
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.910
What kind of monster are you?!

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:48.460
I'm not an experienced fighter! 
Show some restraint!

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:55.010
<i>Damn... Maybe I was too hasty.</i>

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:58.160
<i>But I basically just need 
to overwrite her mind control</i>

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:01.060
<i>with magic that's stronger 
than whoever's controlling her!</i>

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:07.550
Come, Natra Cinereus!

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.590
Damn! Did I overdo it?

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:25.410
Where's Kirasaka?

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:33.400
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:45.330
Don't hold this against me, Kirasaka!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.240
I'll be taking Yume-chan back.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.600
Wow!

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:27.190
You don't get it, do you?

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:30.570
There's absolutely no reason 
for you to take Riru back, is there?

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:34.550
Even if you only directed Sayaka-san 
to attack Senpai while she was brainwashed,

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.590
I believe that's more than enough 
reason to see you as an enemy.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:42.310
Kusuki Elysee is legally recognized 
as Eguchi Yume's guardian,

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:46.380
and she is trying to return 
there of her own free will.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:50.840
Even the Lion King Organization 
has no right to stop her.

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.110
You're right...

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:55.550
assuming that's what 
Yume-chan actually wants!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.950
You knew this spear's true identity?

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.550
The timing was just too perfect.

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.150
The Ricercare of the Taishi Bureau,

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:11.940
a spear that accumulates and amplifies 
magical power before releasing it.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.550
Yume-chan's succubus powers 
were accumulated within that spear,

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:20.400
and that's what awakened Riru's personality 
and brainwashed Sayaka-san, right?

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.880
Yes, that's right.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:26.800
Though I never expected all that 
stored power to be depleted in this way.

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:28.770
Yukina-oneesan!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.430
Now I have a reason to stop you.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.830
Or will you choose to leave here right now?

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:41.450
If you think you've won just by sealing 
Ricercare's power, you are naïve!

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.840
Mist Leopard: Twin Moons!

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.360
Schneesturm Wolfin!

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:02.230
Blood... My own blood...

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:11.920
I thought you were just a little girl 
with nothing going for you but your looks,

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:14.860
but now I see why you 
are the Fourth Progenitor's observer.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.140
It's a shame we've run out of time.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:18.850
Out of time?

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.080
What is this pulse?

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:27.260
My shadow is mist, and yet not mist;

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:29.740
a blade, and yet not a blade.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.100
Once cut by it, your anguished wails

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:34.320
will sing the melody of 
disaster, as in a dream!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:40.440
Yume-chan?

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:42.580
Riru?!

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:45.600
Please stop this.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:48.480
Both of you, Kiriha-san and Yukina-oneesan.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:53.820
It's all right now. 
I'll end all of this myself.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.870
Yume-chan, why...

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.120
Hey, you're awake.

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:19.580
A-Akatsuki Kojou?!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.650
You're not hurt?

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:25.150
But I ran you through with Koukarin!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.960
Oh, so you remember what happened 
while you were being controlled?

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:34.190
A-Akatsuki Kojou, I... um...

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:35.660
It's fine.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:37.550
I did it on my own,

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:41.470
and the blood I took 
from you made up for what I lost.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.480
How typical, Senpai.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:48.880
I take my eyes off of you for a moment,

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.730
and you take Sayaka-san's blood?

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:51.840
Yukina?!

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.510
No, no! Taking her blood was...

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:55.410
an emergency procedure, you know?

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.240
Like, I had to do it to save her life!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:00.490
I know that.

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:02.160
More importantly, Senpai...

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:06.540
I was unable to get Yume-chan back.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.110
I'm sorry.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.710
I didn't realize things 
had reached that stage.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:16.810
How could this be?

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:20.320
Kirasaka, if you know 
something, please tell us.

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:23.180
What does Kusuki Elysee 
want to do with Yume?

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:27.440
Her role is to be a sacrifice.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:29.680
A sacrifice?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.320
Chairman Kusuki of Kusuki Elysee

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.270
intends to use Yume's power as the successor

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:39.290
of Lilith, the Witch of the Night 
and strongest succubus in the world,

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:43.080
to control a biological weapon buried 
at the bottom of the ocean.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.630
A biological weapon?

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.830
Is it something like Nalakuvera?

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:49.850
No.

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:53.100
This one is a monster from mythical times.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:56.100
It's not something any human can control.

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.880
So what is this monster?

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:03.520
You might be familiar 
with its name, if nothing else.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:04.380
Huh?

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:07.740
The sea monster that's 
even spoken of in the Bible...

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:12.400
The Serpent of Envy, the strongest 
being ever created by the gods...

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:14.010
Leviathan.

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:20.910
So that's LYL?

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.100
It's smaller than I expected.

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:26.360
<i>This is but one part of Riru.</i>

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.380
<i>The control module, to be precise.</i>

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:31.840
<i>That's why it was possible 
to make it so small.</i>

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:37.950
How ironic that the world's most powerful 
succubus, Lilith, is such a small child.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:40.770
Chairman.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:44.220
I've verified the position of the serpent.

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:48.300
It is roughly 40 nautical miles 
southwest of Itogami Island,

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.690
at a depth of approximately 400 meters.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.560
<i>All according to our calculations, then!</i>

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:56.650
I am grateful for your cooperation.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:00.370
If I can successfully tame the serpent,

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.620
perhaps I can repay my debt to you.

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:08.990
For crying out loud... I wake up 
to find a huge hole in the yard,

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:11.330
plus Kirasaka-san is suddenly here,

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.420
and you tell me that 
Yume-chan's been taken away?

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:15.910
And now we're dealing 
with a giant biological weapon?

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:18.520
Gimme a break already! 
Why is it always like this?!

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.880
I'm sorry, Asagi... but we have to hurry.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:23.610
Yume's life depends on it.

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:26.250
I know, I know! That's why I'm—

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:29.540
There it is! Look, this must be Leviathan.

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:30.220
Huh?

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.700
Wait, where?

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:34.000
All of this, from here to here.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.340
What?! That's enormous!

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:38.800
A bit over 4,000 meters, it looks like.

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:41.480
They call it the world's strongest 
magical beast for good reason.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:47.130
And the chairman of Kusuki Elysee 
is trying to tame this thing?

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:50.480
Yes, using the power of Lilith

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:52.340
that slumbers within Eguchi Yume.

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:55.210
And this was probably instigated by...

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:56.680
The Taishi Bureau.

00:19:58.060 --> 00:20:00.940
But aren't they a federal organization?

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:02.730
Why would they do that?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.170
I don't know.

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:07.310
Hey! What're you whispering about?

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:09.810
Oh, uh, just... yeah!

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:15.310
Just wondering why Kusuki Elysee wants 
to try to control Leviathan.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.830
That's pretty easy to imagine.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:23.450
The chairman, a man named Kusuki, 
has invested in TrueArc.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:24.820
TrueArc?

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:27.360
They call themselves 
an environmentalist group,

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:30.670
but they're actually a terrorist organization

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:33.410
that conducts sabotage under 
the pretext of saving magical beasts.

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:37.120
The head of Kusuki Elysee, a company 
that buys and sells magical beasts,

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.590
invested in a group like that?

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.900
You know how these types are.

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.210
They probably both believe 
they're in the right.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.410
If someone who backs such extreme 
measures to protect magical beasts

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:49.870
gets a hold of the most powerful 
biological weapon in the world,

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.400
there'll be some trouble.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.780
What a load of bullshit!

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:56.050
This Kusuki bastard wants to sacrifice Yume

00:20:56.050 --> 00:21:00.120
for his own self-serving 
idea of what's right?!

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:03.160
Seriously, creeps like these 
are out of control.

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:05.710
"LYL"?

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.620
A control module 
for Leviathan and... "Yotaka"?

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:12.410
I get it. So the actual operations 
are being done at the lab.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:16.680
A-Aiba-san, did you break 
into Kusuki Elysee's computer?

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.040
Kojou!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.500
Yume-chan is already 
headed toward Leviathan!

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:22.550
Kusuki's with her!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:28.300
But if I can take over this "LYL" 
system in Kusuki Elysee's lab,

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:29.760
I can block their plans.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:31.040
"Riru"?

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:33.250
An AI made by porting part 
of Yume-chan's personality

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:37.310
into a computer in order 
to draw out her succubus powers.

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:39.770
You might call it a virtual alter ego.

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:45.630
A personality called "Riru" 
that helps Kusuki...

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:49.840
Asagi, can you take down this "Riru" system?

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:53.610
This laptop doesn't have a lot of power...

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:55.080
But with enough time, I think I can.

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:56.590
Do it, then!

00:21:57.630 --> 00:21:58.880
Hang on, Kojou!

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:00.920
Where are you going, 
after dumping a task like that on me?!

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:03.160
Wait, Akatsuki Kojou!

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.390
You're not thinking of...

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:07.760
I'm going to get Yume back.

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:11.020
This is <i>my</i> job, in case you forgot!

00:22:11.690 --> 00:22:13.600
Then, help me!

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:15.630
I need a way to go after a submarine!

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:18.660
How do you expect me to—

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:19.700
If I may...

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:22.770
Are there any extra boats at Kusuki Elysee?

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:26.490
I think there was a high-speed craft...

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:29.610
But I'm not sure 
if it could catch up to them.

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:32.030
Then, let's get moving right away!

00:22:32.730 --> 00:22:34.740
You're coming with us, Himeragi?

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:36.460
Of course I am.

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:38.640
I'm your observer, remember?

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:40.250
Besides...

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:44.890
It's my fault we couldn't 
get Yume-chan back last time.

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:49.940
Okay. I'm counting on you.

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:50.590
Right!

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:55.310
U-Um, this was supposed to be my job...

00:22:55.590 --> 00:22:58.060
Whoa! Where'd that giant hole come from?!

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:00.320
Hey! What the hell's going on?!

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:02.320
Nothing! Go back to sleep!

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:08.650
<i>Just wait, Yume.</i>

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:11.780
<i>You're not Lilith or Riru.</i>

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:14.920
<i>I won't let them make 
a sacrifice out of you!</i>

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:20.680
Very soon...

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:25.800
The iron hammer of justice will come 
down upon the conceited human race.
